<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9B06007001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<ptxt>
Engine mount rear bracket is to be reused.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9B06007002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove engine mount rear bracket. (Vehicle right side only)
</ptxt>
<figure>
