<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9B06007003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s). 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9B04004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For type B right side, install apron front extension patch to apron front extension.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILJA0A9B0007.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "79.528mm" ver = "01" gw = "244" gh = "209"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install apron front member and apron front extension.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld and plug weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<title>
Vehicle right side
